From: dArkOS RG52 Mini port
Subject: Home does not toggle Bluetooth

The RG52 Mini builds ogage from the RG503 branch, which runs bttoggle.sh at
every press of BTN_MODE. On the RG52 Mini that button is Home, the one
RetroArch takes as its hotkey enable, so opening RetroArch's menu with
Home+X, or any other hotkey, turned Bluetooth on or off as well.
Bluetooth is still switched in Options > Bluetooth (Bluetooth.sh).

